---
import BaseHead from '../../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead 
			title="Avatar Universe Universities - CartoonCampus"
			description="Explore the University of Ba Sing Se from Avatar: The Last Airbender. Master earthbending, history, and society in the Earth Kingdom's greatest city."
		/>
		<style>
			.avatar-hero {
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.15) 0%, rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.1) 100%);
				border-radius: 16px;
				padding: 3rem 2rem;
				margin-bottom: 3rem;
				border: 2px solid rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.2);
				text-align: center;
				position: relative;
				overflow: hidden;
			}

			.avatar-hero::before {
				content: '';
				position: absolute;
				top: -50%;
				right: -50%;
				width: 200%;
				height: 200%;
				background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
				animation: earthen 20s ease-in-out infinite;
			}

			@keyframes earthen {
				0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
				50% { transform: translate(30px, 30px); }
			}

			.hero-content {
				position: relative;
				z-index: 2;
			}

			.avatar-hero h1 {
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669, #047857);
				-webkit-background-clip: text;
				-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
				background-clip: text;
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
				font-size: 3.5rem;
			}

			.avatar-hero .tagline {
				font-size: 1.25rem;
				color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
				max-width: 700px;
				margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
				line-height: 1.8;
			}

			.avatar-hero .intro {
				font-size: 1rem;
				color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
				max-width: 800px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				line-height: 1.7;
			}

			.back-link {
				display: inline-block;
				margin-bottom: 2rem;
				padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
				color: var(--accent);
				text-decoration: none;
				font-weight: 600;
				transition: all 0.3s ease;
			}

			.back-link:hover {
				transform: translateX(-4px);
			}

			.universities-grid {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
				gap: 2rem;
				margin-bottom: 3rem;
			}

			.university-card {
				background: white;
				border-radius: 16px;
				padding: 2.5rem;
				box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
				border: 2px solid rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.1);
				transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
				text-decoration: none;
				color: inherit;
				position: relative;
				overflow: hidden;
			}

			.university-card::before {
				content: '';
				position: absolute;
				top: 0;
				left: 0;
				right: 0;
				height: 4px;
				background: linear-gradient(90deg, #059669, #047857);
			}

			.university-card:hover {
				transform: translateY(-8px);
				box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
				border-color: #059669;
			}

			.card-icon {
				font-size: 2.5rem;
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
			}

			.card-title {
				font-size: 1.75rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				color: rgb(var(--black));
				margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
			}

			.card-location {
				font-size: 0.95rem;
				color: #059669;
				font-weight: 600;
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
			}

			.card-description {
				font-size: 0.95rem;
				line-height: 1.6;
				color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
				margin: 1.5rem 0;
			}

			.card-programs {
				font-size: 0.9rem;
				color: #059669;
				font-weight: 500;
				margin: 1rem 0;
			}

			.explore-btn {
				display: inline-block;
				margin-top: 1.5rem;
				padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669, #047857);
				color: white;
				text-decoration: none;
				border-radius: 8px;
				font-weight: 600;
				transition: all 0.3s ease;
			}

			.explore-btn:hover {
				transform: translateX(4px);
				box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.3);
			}

			.context-box {
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.08) 0%, rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.08) 100%);
				border-left: 4px solid #059669;
				border-radius: 12px;
				padding: 2rem;
				margin-bottom: 3rem;
			}

			.context-box h2 {
				margin-top: 0;
				color: rgb(var(--black));
			}

			.context-box p {
				color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
				line-height: 1.7;
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
			}

			.context-box ul {
				margin: 1rem 0;
				padding-left: 2rem;
				color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
			}

			.context-box li {
				margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
			}

			.store-cta {
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.1) 0%, rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.1) 100%);
				border: 2px solid #059669;
				border-radius: 12px;
				padding: 2rem;
				text-align: center;
				margin-top: 3rem;
			}

			.store-cta h3 {
				margin-top: 0;
				color: rgb(var(--black));
			}

			.store-cta p {
				color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
				margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
			}

			.store-link {
				display: inline-block;
				padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669, #047857);
				color: white;
				text-decoration: none;
				border-radius: 8px;
				font-weight: 600;
				transition: all 0.3s ease;
			}

			.store-link:hover {
				transform: translateY(-2px);
				box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.4);
			}

			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				.avatar-hero {
					padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
				}

				.avatar-hero h1 {
					font-size: 2.5rem;
				}

				.avatar-hero .tagline {
					font-size: 1.1rem;
				}

				.universities-grid {
					grid-template-columns: 1fr;
					gap: 1.5rem;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<a href="../" class="back-link">← Back to Fictional Worlds</a>

			<section class="avatar-hero">
				<div class="hero-content">
					<h1>🏔️ Avatar Universe</h1>
					<p class="tagline">The Last Airbender's Earth Kingdom</p>
					<p class="intro">
						Welcome to the heart of Earth Kingdom education. Ba Sing Se stands as a monument to earthen tradition and stability. 
					
Our university trains benders and non-benders alike in the art of earthbending, history, philosophy, and inclusive society building.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="context-box">
				<h2>📚 About the Avatar Universe</h2>
				<p>
					In the world of Avatar: The Last Airbender, the University of Ba Sing Se represents the best of Earth Kingdom education. 
					A place where earthbenders master their craft, where history and philosophy are deeply respected, and where benders and 
					non-benders work together to build a stronger society.
				</p>
				<p><strong>Key Themes:</strong></p>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>Earthbending:</strong> Military applications, construction, and mastery</li>
					<li><strong>Earth Kingdom History:</strong> 4,000 years of tradition and culture</li>
					<li><strong>Architecture & Engineering:</strong> The walls that protect civilization</li>
					<li><strong>Inclusive Society:</strong> Building systems that work for all, bender and non-bender</li>
					<li><strong>Philosophy:</strong> Balance, earth, stability, and the Avatar's role</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section class="universities-grid">
				<a href="./ba-sing-se-university/" class="university-card">
					<div class="card-icon">🏔️</div>
					<h3 class="card-title">University of Ba Sing Se</h3>
					<p class="card-location">📍 Ba Sing Se, Earth Kingdom</p>
					<p class="card-description">
						The Earth Kingdom's center of learning. Where earthbenders become leaders, scholars study history and philosophy, 
						and students learn to build a society that values all its citizens.
					</p>
					<p class="card-programs">🎓 3 Featured Courses</p>
					<span class="explore-btn">Explore Ba Sing Se U →</span>
				</a>
			</section>

			<section class="store-cta">
				<h3>Show Your Earth Kingdom Pride</h3>
				<p>
					Whether you're an earthbender, a scholar of Earth Kingdom culture, or devoted fan of Avatar, 
					wear your affiliation with pride. Our official Avatar Universe merchandise celebrates the traditions of Ba Sing Se.
				</p>
				<a href="https://store.cartooncampus.ca/avatar" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="store-link">
					Shop Avatar Universe Merch
				</a>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>